Atlas data

The app registers to the JHU ICBM-DTI-81 white-matter FA template and warps its
label atlas. Both are read from the FSL installation inside the container
($FSLDIR/data/atlases/JHU) and are distributed with FSL under the FSL licence
for non-commercial research use. templates/JHU-ICBM-labels.json carries only the
region names and abbreviations used to label the output tables.

  Mori S, Wakana S, van Zijl PCM, Nagae-Poetscher LM.
  MRI Atlas of Human White Matter. Elsevier, Amsterdam, 2005.
